OL,6,     FTeleshopping with High Street TV
OL,7,G0855 Four in a Bed
OL,8,     FThe week begins at the Peniarth
OL,9,     FArms in Wales, with hosts Susanne
OL,10,     Fand Anwen. Toby and Kath feel like
OL,11,     Fthey've been transported in time,
OL,12,     Fwhile Ryan and Sarah kick up a
OL,13,     Ffuss about their room.
OL,14,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,15,     FThe second destination of the week
OL,16,     Fis Apple Camping in Pembrokeshire.
OL,17,     FHost Toby's guests appreciate his
OL,18,     Funique take on glamping, but a
OL,19,     Flack of basics makes for some
OL,20,     Fnot-so-happy campers.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/13
