OL,5,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FAt The Garden House in Somerset,
OL,7,     Fhost and chef Ryan hopes that his
OL,8,     Fbrekkie will impress his guests.
OL,9,     FBut some find the food difficult
OL,10,     Fto stomach, resulting in some
OL,11,     Fhard-to-swallow feedback.
OL,12,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FJames hosts the week's final visit
OL,14,     Fat Ivy House in St Austell. His
OL,15,     Fguests marvel at the delightful
OL,16,     Fviews, but the lack of a lock and
OL,17,     Fa substandard sausage put James
OL,18,     Funder scrutiny.
