OL,5,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe B&Bers meet on payment day to
OL,7,     Fsettle some scores. Sleep troubles
OL,8,     Fand breakfast bugbears are on the
OL,9,     Fagenda, before the payments are
OL,10,     Frevealed and the winner is
OL,11,     Fannounced.
OL,12,G1135 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FLeeds. Proud dog mum Jill hopes
OL,14,     Fthat her simple vegan menu and
OL,15,     Fsaucy entertainment will fare well
OL,16,     Fwith her guests. But will they be
OL,17,     Fleft red-faced and with rumbling
OL,18,     Ftums? (Ep1/5)
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG3/13
